{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"diff","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Diff and Patch","description":"Syntax coloring for Diff and Patch (.diff .patch .rej).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"diff","name":"Diff and Patch","extensions":[".diff",".patch",".rej"],"grammar":"grammars/diff.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/diff.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^diff --git .*$|^index [0-9a-f]+\\\\.\\\\.[0-9a-f]+.*$|^(?:---|\\\\+\\\\+\\\\+) .*$\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^@@.*@@\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\+.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^-.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\\\\\ No newline.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Diff and Patch\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling for Diff and Patch.\n\n## Files\n\n`.diff`, `.patch`, `.rej`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}